  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "Jer.30.23 has several possible root assignments in the corpus. The storm and the following verb support a sweeping or whirling movement. The connection between drawing a load, drawing up cud and sawing remains uncertain. The homonymous weight is under gerah and the olive fruit under gargar. Gerar is a place name of uncertain derivation."
